  "system": {
    "identifier": "titanbound_world_anchor",
    "description": {
      "value": "<h2 data-start=\"7413\" data-end=\"7430\">WORLD ANCHOR</h2><p data-start=\"7431\" data-end=\"7444\"><em data-start=\"7431\" data-end=\"7444\">“No. Stay.”</em></p><h3 data-start=\"7446\" data-end=\"7466\">Subclass Fantasy</h3><p data-start=\"7467\" data-end=\"7502\">World Anchors do not chase enemies.</p><p data-start=\"7504\" data-end=\"7542\">They remove the <strong data-start=\"7520\" data-end=\"7541\">concept of escape</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"7544\" data-end=\"7636\">Reality behaves differently near them —<br data-start=\"7583\" data-end=\"7586\" />paths close, gates stutter, and leylines hesitate.</p><p>World Anchors are:</p><ul data-start=\"10009\" data-end=\"10096\"><li data-start=\"10009\" data-end=\"10027\"><p data-start=\"10011\" data-end=\"10027\">Escape deniers</p></li><li data-start=\"10028\" data-end=\"10044\"><p data-start=\"10030\" data-end=\"10044\">Gate killers</p></li><li data-start=\"10045\" data-end=\"10096\"><p data-start=\"10047\" data-end=\"10096\">The reason clever enemies suddenly look worried</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"10098\" data-end=\"10144\">Leylines don’t fear them.<br data-start=\"10123\" data-end=\"10126\" />Leylines hesitate.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
